
String: it is a sequence of characters in double quotes (""). Template expression always start with dollar sign ($).

String is a immutable. 

## Example : 
fun main(){
    val name = "Mary"
    val age = 20 

    print("$name is $age years old")
}


## Declare a String :

val name : String = "Kotlin"
val msg = "Hello World"       //kotlin infers string

2.("") strings literals support escape sequences such as "/n" or "/t"

val msg = "Hello, /nWorld"
val msg = "kotlin says, \"Hi\ "."
